    {
      "id": "hero",
      "order": 1,
      "title": "品牌战略定位",
      "subtitle": "嫣红小主 = 东方花果茶 × 精酿工艺 × 国风美学",
      "navLabel": "战略定位",
      "content": "<div class=\"hero-inner\">\n          <div class=\"hero-badge\">嫣红小主 · 果茶鲜酿</div>\n          <h1 class=\"hero-title\">嫣红悦己<br>小主尽欢</h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-desc\">嫣红小主=东方花果茶×鲜酿工艺×国风美学<br>不是传统啤酒，不是传统精酿，不是普通果酒，是\"可以喝的东方美学\"。</p>\n          <div class=\"hero-tags\">\n            <span>东方鲜酿</span>\n            <span>花果茶鲜酿</span>\n            <span>真花真果真茶真鲜酿</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T13:18:37.987Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "brand-core",
      "order": 2,
      "title": "品牌内涵",
      "subtitle": "品牌释义 · 核心人群 · 价值体系",
      "navLabel": "品牌内涵",
      "content": "<div class=\"dual-drive\">\n          <div class=\"drive-col\">\n            <div class=\"drive-header\">\n              <h3>品牌释义</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"drive-items\" style=\"gap:var(--space-lg);\">\n              <div class=\"drive-item\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;\"><span style=\"color:var(--color-primary);font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;\">\"嫣红\"</span> —— 色彩，取自古典诗词的一抹绝色</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;\"><span style=\"color:var(--color-gold);font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;\">\"小主\"</span> —— 身份，悦己自在的生活态度</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-col drive-floral\">\n            <div class=\"drive-header\">\n              <h3>核心人群</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"drive-items\" style=\"gap:var(--space-lg);\">\n              <div class=\"drive-item\" style=\"font-size:1rem;\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span><strong>核心用户：</strong>20-35岁城市年轻女性<br>新国风女孩，追求生活美学<br>热爱传统文化、乐于打卡分享</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\" style=\"font-size:1rem;\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span><strong>延展用户：</strong>25-40岁精酿爱好者<br>男性为主，追求品质口感与差异化风味</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"values-grid\">\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>品牌亮点</h4><h4>东方微醺美学</h4></div>\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>品牌定位</h4><h4>东方花果茶鲜酿</h4></div>\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>品牌品类</h4><h4>果茶鲜酿</h4></div>\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>品牌核心价值</h4><h4>真花真果真茶真鲜酿，东方鲜酿</h4></div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"highlight-quote\">文化母体：《楚辞》与东方美学的微醺主义<br>品牌使命：让每一杯鲜酿成为东方风雅的日常表达，让每一次微醺成为悦己时光的仪式感</blockquote>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-15T03:32:10.865Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "brand-discourse",
      "order": 3,
      "title": "品牌话语体系",
      "subtitle": "品牌广告语及文化传播矩阵文案",
      "navLabel": "话语体系",
      "content": "<div class=\"values-grid\">\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>主广告语</h4><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">嫣红悦己，小主尽欢。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>副广告语</h4><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">东方风雅，微醺悦己。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"value-card\"><h4>辅助广告语</h4><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">小聚微醺，嫣红悦己。</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"highlight-quote\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\"寻得姹紫嫣红，酿作人间微醺。\"<br>\"嫣红是夜晚的诗，小主在人间相见欢。\"</blockquote>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\">品牌文化感受</h3>\n        <div class=\"comp-grid\">\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">品牌传播</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红坊里嫣红酿，嫣红酿待小主尝。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">花间集系列</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">花间一壶花间酒，花间酒醉花间友。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">限定款传播</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">莫遣枝头银烛暗，辜负嫣红。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">春季/门店</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红小主嫣红酿，一杯饮罢春风漾。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">文创礼盒</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红枝下嫣红盏，嫣红盏里醉流年。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">短视频传播</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">半醒半醉小主颜，嫣红一抹在唇边。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">产品详情页</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红盏里嫣红酒，嫣红酒映小主眸。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">TVC/沉浸空间</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红深处嫣红醉，嫣红醉里不知岁。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">四时酿主线</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">四时风物四时酿，四时酿待小主访。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">节气传播</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">二十四番花信风，吹入嫣红酒盏中。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">西游联名</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">花果山前花果鲜，花果鲜酿小主颜。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">生日活动</h3><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.95rem;\">百果吟成百果酒，百果酒敬小主寿。</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin:var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);\">产品系列专属广告语</h3>\n        <div class=\"comp-grid\">\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">花间集</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">花间一壶酒，独酌也无妨。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">百果吟</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">山果熟，水花香，一杯嫣红醉流光。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">四时酿</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">四时风物四时酿，四时酿待小主访。</p></div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">十二钗</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">莫遣枝头银烛暗，辜负嫣红。</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"highlight-quote\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-3xl);\">\"寻得姹紫嫣红，酿作人间微醺。\"</blockquote>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T13:11:10.816Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "products",
      "order": 4,
      "title": "产品系列",
      "subtitle": "13款 · 小主尽欢首发 · 4款微醺鲜酿 · 8款嫣红鲜酿",
      "navLabel": "产品结构",
      "content": "<div class=\"comp-grid\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);\">\n  <div class=\"comp-card\" style=\"text-align:center;background:#7A1F1F;border:1px solid #C9A050;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(201,160,80,0.25);margin:0 auto;max-width:360px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:#C9A050;letter-spacing:0.15em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">嫣红小主 · 花果鲜酿</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:#E8D5A3;margin-bottom:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;\">— 主 打 款 —</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#E8D5A3;margin:0.5rem 0 0.75rem 0;letter-spacing:0.1em;\">小主尽欢</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:1rem;color:#E8D5A3;\">樱桃玫瑰风味花果鲜酿</p>\n  </div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\">微醺鲜酿 · 传统精酿</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\">以东方意象重新命名，每一款都有风雅</p>\n\n<div class=\"comp-grid\">\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">金涛玉液</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">德式小麦</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 12.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥4.5%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">麦香奔涌如金涛，绵密顺滑，玉液天成。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">雪落浮花</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">比利时小麦</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 11.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥4.0%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">清爽淡雅，橘香悠长，如雪落浮花。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">墨染山河</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">牛奶世涛 · 原浆鲜啤</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 16.8°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥5.0%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">牛奶般丝滑，咖啡焦香交织，如墨染山河，一饮深沉。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">悟心修道</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">修道院原浆鲜啤</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 24.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥10.5%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">深色醇厚，焦香回甘，悟心修道方得至味。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin:var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);\">嫣红鲜酿 · 花果茶鲜酿</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\">真花真果真茶真鲜酿，东方鲜酿</p>\n\n<div class=\"comp-grid\">\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">醉心小主</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">0°无醇世涛 · 鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">酒精度 0%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">零度微醺，花气醉人。不饮酒亦得微醺之乐。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">月夜未央</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">桂花小麦</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 11.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥3.7%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">月夜桂香浮动，浅酌未央。秋意入盏，一饮沁芳。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">贵妃回眸</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">荔枝海盐风味鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 7.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥3.3%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">荔枝果香加海盐微咸，回眸一笑百媚生。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">沁心茉兰</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">茉莉青柠风味花果鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 9.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥2.5%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">茉莉幽香遇青柠清冽，沁人心脾，若兰之馨。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">伊人清影</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">凤梨百香果果泥鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 8.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥2.5%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">凤梨甜润遇百香果奔放，果泥入酿，热带风情，所谓伊人。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">兰心小主</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">芭乐蜜桃微果泥鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">原麦汁浓度 8.0°P &nbsp;|&nbsp; 酒精度 ≥2.5%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">芭乐清香交织蜜桃甜润，兰心蕙质，一抹粉红。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">人间乌龙</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">乌龙柚子风味气泡水风味鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">酒精度 0%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">乌龙茶韵遇见柚子清甜，气泡轻舞，醉是人间清醒。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--color-primary-dark);\">冷香红袖</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">西柚茉莉味汽水风味鲜酿</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-gold);margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);\">酒精度 0%vol</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;\">西柚微苦碰撞茉莉清香，冷萃清冽，红袖添香夜读书。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin:var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);\">产品系列归属</h3>\n<div class=\"comp-grid\">\n  <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.95rem;\">花间集</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;\">沁心茉兰、伊人清影<br>花入酒中，微醺生香</p></div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.95rem;\">百果吟</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;\">贵妃回眸、兰心小主<br>鲜果入酿，一饮风雅</p></div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.95rem;\">四时酿</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;\">冷香红袖、醉心小主<br>应季而酿，四季风物</p></div>\n  <div class=\"comp-card\"><h3 style=\"font-size:0.95rem;\">嫣红十二钗</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;\">月夜未央、人间乌龙<br>十二金钗，十二种微醺</p></div>\n</div>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T13:12:14.666Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "business-model",
      "order": 5,
      "title": "商业模式",
      "subtitle": "四大收入来源 · 门店体系 · 扩张规划",
      "navLabel": "商业模式",
      "content": "<div class=\"model-tiers\">\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">收入一</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>直营门店销售 <span>· 短期核心</span></h3>\n              <p>3家验证→20家（3年），单店月营收15-30万，年营收180-360万/店。</p>\n              <div class=\"tier-metrics\"><span>月营收 15-30万</span><span>年营收 180-360万/店</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">收入二</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>加盟业务 <span>· 中期扩张</span></h3>\n              <p>加盟费15-30万/店（一次性），品牌管理费营收3-5%（持续性），供应链利润约10-15%。3年目标20直营+280加盟。</p>\n              <div class=\"tier-metrics\"><span>加盟费 15-30万</span><span>管理费 3-5%</span><span>供应链 10-15%</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">收入三</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>文创衍生品 <span>· 长期增长</span></h3>\n              <p>「小主雅物」(29-99元) +「嫣红十二席」(99-299元) +「小主典藏」(299-999元)。参考茶颜悦色零售年销5亿+。</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">收入四</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>区域加盟/城市合伙人 <span>· 长期扩张</span></h3>\n              <p>区域代理费50-200万/区域，区域管理费分成。作为全国化扩张的重要杠杆。</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dual-drive\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-3xl);\">\n          <div class=\"drive-col\">\n            <div class=\"drive-header\"><h3>单店成本结构</h3><span class=\"drive-percent\">单店投入 15万</span></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-items\">\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>装修（40-60㎡）：5-8万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>设备：3-5万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>首批铺货：2-3万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>租金押金：1.5-3万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>人员招聘培训：1-2万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>开业营销：1-2万</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-col drive-floral\">\n            <div class=\"drive-header\"><h3>盈利能力</h3><span class=\"drive-percent\">净利率 15-25%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"drive-items\">\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>日均客流量：80-150人</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>客单价：60-120元</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>日均成本：约1000元</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>旺季日营业额：5000-6000元</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>综合毛利率：55-65%</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>月营收：15-30万</div>\n              <div class=\"drive-item\"><span class=\"drive-dot\"></span>年营收：180-360万/店</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin:var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);\">门店扩张规划（修订版）</h3>\n        <p style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--color-gold);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);\"> 启动期长沙为核心布局</p>\n        <div class=\"market-path\">\n          <div class=\"path-steps\">\n            <div class=\"path-step\"><span class=\"step-year\">第1年</span><strong>3家</strong><p>直营 · 长沙</p></div>\n            <div class=\"path-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"path-step\"><span class=\"step-year\">第2年</span><strong>58家</strong><p>8直营+50加盟</p></div>\n            <div class=\"path-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"path-step\"><span class=\"step-year\">第3年</span><strong>300家</strong><p>20直营+280加盟</p></div>\n            <div class=\"path-arrow\">→</div>\n            <div class=\"path-step highlight\"><span class=\"step-year\">第5年</span><strong>800家</strong><p>100直营+700加盟</p></div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"path-note\">覆盖：湖南、贵州 → 云南 → 江西、广东、上海、广西</p>\n        </div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "brand-operations",
      "order": 6,
      "title": "品牌模式",
      "subtitle": "三层盈利模型 + 1+2品牌公司运营架构",
      "navLabel": "品牌模式",
      "content": "<div class=\"model-tiers\">\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">第一层</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>前端卖酒赚流水 <span>· 短期现金流</span></h3>\n              <p>直营门店运营：日均客流80-150人，客单价20-120元，综合毛利率40-60%，单店年营收180-360万，单店年净利15-30万。</p>\n              <div class=\"tier-metrics\"><span>毛利率 40-60%</span><span>月营收 15-30万/店</span><span>年净利 15-30万/店</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">第二层</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>中端卖加盟赚规模 <span>· 中期扩张</span></h3>\n              <p>加盟费15-30万/店，品牌管理费营收的3-5%，供应链利润约10-15%。3年目标：20直营+280加盟，品牌端营收5000万-1亿。</p>\n              <div class=\"tier-metrics\"><span>加盟费 15-30万</span><span>管理费 3-5%</span><span>供应链 10-15%</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"model-tier\">\n            <div class=\"tier-label\">第三层</div>\n            <div class=\"tier-details\">\n              <h3>后端卖文创赚品牌 <span>· 长期价值</span></h3>\n              <p>「小主雅物」日用系列（29-99元）+「嫣红十二席」主题系列（99-299元）+「小主典藏」限量系列（299-999元）。参考茶颜悦色零售电商年销破5亿元。</p>\n              <div class=\"tier-metrics\"><span>小主雅物 29-99元</span><span>十二席 99-299元</span><span>典藏 299-999元</span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);text-align:center;margin:var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-xl);\">1+2 品牌公司运营架构</h3>\n        <div class=\"comp-grid\">\n          <div class=\"comp-card\">\n            <h3>嫣红小主品牌运营管理公司（品牌母公司）</h3>\n            <p><strong>◆ 品牌持有方</strong><br><br>核心职能：品牌管理运维、无形资产建设、商业模式规划、商标持有、初创团队建设<br><br>收益来源：管理费1%（按A、B公司营收计提）+ 子公司30%股权收益</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\">\n            <h3>嫣红小主企业管理有限公司（品牌A公司-企管）</h3>\n            <p><strong>◆ 门店运营方</strong><br><br>核心职能：门店终端运营、加盟体系管理、市场开发拓展、供应链体系建设、门店标准化、文创产品零售<br><br>核心指标：门店数量与质量、加盟商满意度</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"comp-card\">\n            <h3>嫣红小主食品科技有限公司（品牌B公司-食品科技）</h3>\n            <p><strong>◆ 渠道零售方</strong><br><br>核心职能：渠道产品零售、区域销售管理、区域市场体系、线上/线下零售渠道、文创产品分发与销售<br><br>核心指标：零售额与渠道覆盖、区域市场渗透率</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"comp-barriers\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-2xl);\">\n          <h3>收益分配机制</h3>\n          <div class=\"barrier-tags\">\n            <span>嫣红小主品牌运营管理公司（品牌母公司）：30%固定股权+1%管理费</span>\n            <span>融资方：70%股权按股比分红</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <blockquote class=\"highlight-quote\">\"前端卖酒赚流水，中端卖加盟赚规模，后端卖文创赚品牌\"——三层盈利模型+1+2公司架构，确保短期现金流+中期扩张+长期品牌价值。</blockquote>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-15T03:33:19.977Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "funding",
      "order": 7,
      "title": "融资需求",
      "subtitle": "融资方案 · 资金用途 · 投资回报 · 退出机制",
      "navLabel": "融资需求",
      "content": "<div class=\"finance-overview\">\n          <div class=\"finance-hero\">\n            <div class=\"finance-card main\"><span class=\"fc-label\">项目实投总额</span><span class=\"fc-value\">100<span>万元</span></span></div>\n            <div class=\"finance-card\"><span class=\"fc-label\">开放融资比例</span><span class=\"fc-value\">70%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"finance-card accent\"><span class=\"fc-label\">融资额</span><span class=\"fc-value\">70<span>万元</span></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"team-assets\">\n            <div class=\"asset-card\"><h3>嫣红小主品牌运营管理公司（品牌母公司）<span>出资30万 · 占股30%</span></h3><ul><li>品牌持有方、管理方</li><li>品牌管理运维</li><li>无形资产及品牌资产建设</li><li>商业模式规划建设</li></ul></div>\n            <div class=\"asset-card\"><h3>融资方（资方）<span>出资70万 · 占股70%</span></h3><ul><li>品牌运营权（A公司）</li><li>门店终端建设</li><li>市场开拓与管理</li><li>按70%股权享受分红</li></ul></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fund-usage\">\n            <h3>资金用途（70万）</h3>\n            <div class=\"usage-bars\">\n              <div class=\"usage-bar\"><span class=\"ub-label\">三家直营门店开设（长沙双城）</span><span class=\"ub-value\">45万 · 60%</span><div class=\"ub-track\"><div class=\"ub-fill\" style=\"width:60%\"></div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"usage-bar\"><span class=\"ub-label\">产品研发与生产</span><span class=\"ub-value\">5万 · 17%</span><div class=\"ub-track\"><div class=\"ub-fill\" style=\"width:17%\"></div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"usage-bar\"><span class=\"ub-label\">品牌营销推广</span><span class=\"ub-value\">10万 · 13%</span><div class=\"ub-track\"><div class=\"ub-fill\" style=\"width:13%\"></div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"usage-bar\"><span class=\"ub-label\">运营流动资金</span><span class=\"ub-value\">5万 · 10%</span><div class=\"ub-track\"><div class=\"ub-fill\" style=\"width:10%\"></div></div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"roi-section\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-3xl);\">\n            <h3>投资回报</h3>\n            <div class=\"roi-cards\">\n              <div class=\"roi-card\"><span>本轮投资额</span><strong>70万（70%）</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"roi-card highlight\"><span>3年估值</span><strong>5000万-1亿</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"roi-card highlight\"><span>5年估值</span><strong>10-20亿</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"roi-card\"><span>回报倍数</span><strong>16-66倍</strong></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timing-list\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-3xl);\">\n          <div class=\"timing-item\">\n            <div class=\"timing-num\" style=\"font-size:1.5rem;\">↗</div>\n            <div class=\"timing-body\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T13:15:47.330Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-3y",
      "order": 8,
      "title": "三年目标",
      "subtitle": "2026-2029",
      "navLabel": "三年目标",
      "content": "<div class=\"vision-phase\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\">\n            <div class=\"vp-header\"><h3>三年目标</h3><span>2026-2029</span></div>\n            <div class=\"vp-goals\">\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 完成3家直营门店模型验证，单店模型成熟可复制（长沙）</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 直营门店拓展至20家，加盟门店280家，总门店300家</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 覆盖湖南、贵州、云南三省</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 10-12款产品全线上市，\"贵妃笑\"成为超级单品</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 文创产品线完整落地，贡献营收占比20%+</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 成为\"东方花果茶鲜酿\"品类的代名词</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">✅ 小红书粉丝10万+，品牌搜索指数进入精酿TOP10</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal accent\">🎯 启动A轮融资，估值5000万-1亿元</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "vision-5y",
      "order": 9,
      "title": "五年愿景",
      "subtitle": "2026-2031",
      "navLabel": "五年愿景",
      "content": "<div class=\"vision-phase highlight\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:var(--space-2xl) auto 0;\">\n            <div class=\"vp-header\"><h3>五年愿景</h3><span>2026-2031</span></div>\n            <div class=\"vp-goals\">\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 全国800+门店（100家直营+700家加盟）</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 覆盖黔、湘、赣、滇、粤、沪、桂七省市</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 年营收突破2-5亿元</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 成为\"国风酒饮第一品牌\"</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 \"嫣红十二钗\"成为全国认知度文化IP</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal\">🏆 从\"卖酒的品牌\"升级为\"东方微醺生活方式品牌\"</div>\n              <div class=\"vp-goal accent\">🎯 启动B轮融资或品牌并购，估值10-20亿元</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <blockquote class=\"highlight-quote ultimate\" style=\"margin-top:var(--space-3xl);\">让\"嫣红小主\"成为东方花果茶鲜酿的代名词——就像茶颜悦色代表了新中式茶饮，霸王茶姬代表了东方茶文化，花西子代表了东方彩妆——嫣红小主，要成为\"东方微醺美学\"的代言人。</blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "id": "appendix",
      "order": 10,
      "title": "嫣红小主",
      "subtitle": "品牌信息速查",
      "navLabel": "嫣红小主",
      "content": "<div class=\"appendix-table\">\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">品牌名</span><span class=\"ap-val\">嫣红小主</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">品牌品类</span><span class=\"ap-val\">果茶鲜酿</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">品牌亮点</span><span class=\"ap-val\">东方微醺美学</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">品牌定位</span><span class=\"ap-val\">东方花果茶鲜酿</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">核心价值</span><span class=\"ap-val\">真花真果真茶真鲜酿，东方鲜酿</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">品牌使命</span><span class=\"ap-val\">让每一杯鲜酿成为东方风雅的日常表达，让每一次微醺成为悦己时光的仪式感</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">主广告语</span><span class=\"ap-val\">嫣红悦己，小主尽欢。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">副广告语</span><span class=\"ap-val\">东方风雅，微醺悦己。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">辅助广告语</span><span class=\"ap-val\">小聚微醺，嫣红悦己。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">产品诠释</span><span class=\"ap-val\">寻得姹紫嫣红，酿作人间微醺。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">竞争区隔</span><span class=\"ap-val\">嫣红是夜晚的诗，小主在人间相见欢。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">产品结构</span><span class=\"ap-val\">10-12款（40%传统精酿+60%花果茶鲜酿）</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">项目实投</span><span class=\"ap-val\">100万元</span></div>\n          <div class=\"ap-row\"><span class=\"ap-key\">融资额</span><span class=\"ap-val\">70万元（占股70%+品牌运营权）</span></div>\n        </div>",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-14T13:16:21.103Z"
    }
  ]
}